  apply (art_wrap_copy MAPS0 RESV0 NOACC0 BASE BUDGET rn scfg Hwx AFL L HLsegs HLlo HLhi HLroimg HLstimg HLlsan PRIVZ PRIVF PRIVCS pcw FRB FRB_rng (RUNX fx)
           R M model LB FF LK cr A dst src n bs K INV Hh HMI H10 H12 ltac:(clear - Hn; change (2 ^ 27) with 134217728 in Hn; change (2 ^ 30) with 1073741824; lia) Hret AST AACC CLW DOK KT0 APPR H11 AACCS SR APPS CLSS RDS (NOV eq_refl)).
